---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/contact/"
pageId: "contact"
title: "Contact"
description: "Reach Uncost by email or on our social channels. A human replies from contact@uncost.org."
---
{#- Markup taken verbatim from design-source/pages/contact.html. CONTENT.md marks this
    page's copy "inline (draft)", so the export supplies both; only asset
    references and routes are rewritten. Do not re-author. -#}
<!-- SECTION: contact.Contact — title -->
<div class="titleband" data-screen-label="Contact — title"><h1><span class="u-1">Contact</span></h1></div>
<div class="introband">
  <h2>{{ pageContent.contact.intro.h2 | safe }}</h2>
  <p>Questions, partnership ideas, in-kind offers, press, or a correction to something we published — send it over. We read everything and reply from a real inbox.</p>
</div>

<!-- SECTION: contact.Contact -->
<div class="cwrap" data-screen-label="Contact">
  <aside class="cside">
    <h3>Email</h3>
    <a class="mail" href="mailto:contact@uncost.org">contact@uncost.org</a>
    <p>Spotted a wrong number or a missing source? Corrections get priority.</p>
    <h3 class="u-41">Follow along</h3>
    {#- The accounts with show: true in chrome.json (social[] order), drawn with
        the footer's glyphs. Email is left out: the address is shown above. -#}
    {%- import "partials/social-icons.njk" as socialIcon %}
    <div class="socrow">
      {%- for s in chrome.social %}{% if s.show and s.label != "Email" %}
      <a href="{{ s.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="{{ s.label }}">{{ socialIcon.glyph(s.label) }}</a>
      {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <h3 class="u-41">Build with us</h3>
    <p>The work is public on <a class="u-1" href="https://github.com/uncost-org/uncost" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a> — open an issue or a pull request.</p>
  </aside>

  <div class="cmain">
    {% include "partials/forms/contact.njk" %}
      </div>
</div>
